---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'About Domain Discoverer | Independent Domain Education';
const description = 'Learn why Domain Discoverer exists: a simple, independent resource for checking domain availability and making clearer domain registration decisions.';
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container-pad">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">About</span></nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 class="display">About Domain Discoverer</h1>
    <p>Domain Discoverer helps people understand domain names, check availability and evaluate options without unnecessary complexity.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="container-pad about-body">
    <div class="about-intro"><span class="section-kicker">Why we exist</span><div class="prose"><p>Finding a domain should not require becoming an expert in domain registries, DNS or aftermarket pricing. Yet a hurried choice can leave you with a difficult name, unexpected renewal costs or a confusing setup.</p><p>Our goal is practical: give you one simple availability check, useful research references and plain-English explanations of what happens next. We do not register domains or promise investment returns.</p></div></div>
    <div class="rail-grid">
      <div class="rail-item"><span class="rail-index">Domain basics</span><h3>Make the basics understandable</h3><p>Explain domains, extensions, hosting and registrations with useful examples.</p></div>
      <div class="rail-item"><span class="rail-index">Practical tools</span><h3>One step at a time</h3><p>Help visitors check a precise name instead of creating an endless stream of suggestions.</p></div>
      <div class="rail-item"><span class="rail-index">Transparency</span><h3>Be transparent</h3><p>Explain third-party links and distinguish live availability from guaranteed registration.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-more"><h2 class="display">Who this is for</h2><div class="prose"><p>Whether you're naming your first business, setting up a small website, comparing options for a client or learning about domain investing, start with the fundamentals. Check the name, consider brand conflicts, compare extensions and prices, then make the final choice with your registrar.</p><p>Have an idea for improving the site or a question we haven't answered? <a href="/contact">Send us a message</a>.</p></div></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .about-body { padding-top: 5rem; }
  .about-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .55fr 1.45fr; gap: 3rem; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .about-intro .prose p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .about-more { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; padding-top: 5rem; }
  .about-more h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.4rem); font-weight: 720; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  
  @media(max-width:750px){ .about-intro,.about-more { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; } }
</style>
